<p>Fire a precise shot dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">163%, 185%, 202%, 217%, 229%</acronym> weapon damage, with 100 increased accuracy. This shot will bypass other enemies between you and your target.</p><p>Only usable against marked targets, and consumes the mark on hit.</p>